      "cooked": "<p>Here’s the problem, I created a custom Doctype “CustomDoctypeA” linked to a custom Module and now I want one of the fields to fetch from another Custom Doctype “CustomDoctypeB”.</p>\n<p>The issue is I’m not able to fetch from “CustomDoctypeB” to “CustomDoctypeA”<br>\ngiven that the :</p>\n<ul>\n<li>field is of <strong>“Link”</strong> type</li>\n<li>Option is “CustomDoctypeB”</li>\n</ul>\n<p>There’s no fetch from results.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/5/d5bb72c5fa0f1c6ea7261b849e976c61993f28e6.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/d5bb72c5fa0f1c6ea7261b849e976c61993f28e6\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/5/d5bb72c5fa0f1c6ea7261b849e976c61993f28e6.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"uuLj3FS3wiCWSjy2s31kquBWmOO\" width=\"358\" height=\"135\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">358×135 5.75 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Am I missing something?</p>",
